{"format":"kane-fabric-administrative-descriptor","format_version":1,"descriptor_id":"us.il.condominium.collections","descriptor_version":1,"title":"Illinois Condominium — Assessment Collection, Liens & Remedies","help":"Statewide Illinois condominium collection, lien, foreclosure, and default-remedy framework. Statutory rules are Infrastructure; balances, collection policies, lien recordings, counsel activity, and case status are association-instance data.","scope":{"country_code":"US","state_code":"IL","label":"Illinois statewide condominium infrastructure","applies_to":"condominium_assessment_collection","as_of_date":"2026-09-17","admission_rule":"Only current statewide Illinois condominium collection rules are Infrastructure. Association collection policies, charges, notices, counsel decisions, case facts, county recording details, and court outcomes are instance data."},"categories":[{"id":"collection.assessments","label":"Assessment collection"},{"id":"collection.lien","label":"Statutory lien"},{"id":"collection.remedies","label":"Default remedies"},{"id":"collection.foreclosure","label":"Foreclosure and successor obligations"}],"authorities":[{"id":"il-condo-act-9","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/9","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K9","summary":"Assessment payment, statutory lien, lien priority, recording, foreclosure, purchaser obligations, and encumbrancer statements."},{"id":"il-condo-act-9-2","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/9.2","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/Legislation/ILCS/Articles?ActID=2200&ChapterID=62","summary":"Other remedies, attorney fees, and conditions for charging managing-agent collection fees to an owner."},{"id":"il-condo-act-18-4","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18.4(l)","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18.4","summary":"Late-payment charges and reasonable fines after notice and an opportunity to be heard."}],"pages":[{"id":"assessment-collection","title":"Assessment Collection, Liens & Remedies","help":"The statewide framework identifies what Illinois law supplies. Association-specific balances, fees, notices, lien filings, and proceedings instantiate that framework.","sections":[{"id":"statewide-collection-framework","title":"Statewide collection and lien framework","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9","il-condo-act-9-2","il-condo-act-18-4"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"assessment-payment-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Payment of an assessment is due in the amounts and at the times determined by the board of managers.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"statutory-lien-scope","kind":"notice","text":"When due amounts of common expenses or an unpaid fine are not paid, the unpaid amount together with applicable interest, late charges, reasonable attorney fees, and collection costs constitutes a statutory lien on the unit owner's interest, subject to the priority rules in Section 9.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9","il-condo-act-18-4"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"lien-priority-rule","kind":"notice","text":"The condominium lien is subject to the statutory priority exceptions for specified taxes and qualifying prior-recorded encumbrances. The descriptor does not infer priority from filing order alone.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"lien-recording-foreclosure-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Notice of the lien may be recorded as provided by Section 9, and after recording the lien may be foreclosed in the name of the board of managers in the same manner as a mortgage of real property.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"successor-current-expense-rule","kind":"notice","text":"A foreclosure-sale purchaser or mortgagee taking title or possession in the circumstances specified by Section 9 must pay the unit's proportionate common expenses beginning with the first day of the following month; qualifying payment confirms extinguishment of the prior owner's lien in the circumstances stated by the statute.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"six-month-successor-rule","kind":"notice","text":"A non-mortgagee foreclosure purchaser, or a purchaser acquiring title from a mortgagee, may owe unpaid common expenses that would have become due without acceleration during the 6 months immediately preceding institution of an action to enforce collection, subject to the conditions in Section 9(g)(4).","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"encumbrancer-statement-rule","kind":"notice","text":"An encumbrancer may request a written statement of unpaid common expenses. If the manager or board does not comply within 20 days, unpaid common expenses due before the request are subordinate to that encumbrance as provided by Section 9(j).","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"attorney-fee-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Attorney fees incurred by the association arising from an owner default under the condominium instruments, rules, or applicable law are added to and deemed part of that owner's share of the common expense under Section 9.2(b).","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"manager-fee-boundary","kind":"notice","text":"Other than attorney fees, a managing-agent collection fee may be charged to an owner's share only when it relates to association collection costs, is set forth in the management contract, and authority to add it is specifically stated in the declaration or bylaws.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":5,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"fine-due-process-boundary","kind":"notice","text":"The board may impose late-payment charges and may levy reasonable fines for violations only after notice and an opportunity to be heard. A fine recorded in a collection case should therefore retain the association evidence establishing that prerequisite.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":5,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"default-remedy-rule","kind":"notice","text":"For a default under the Act or condominium instruments, Section 9.2 preserves the association's statutory and instrument-based remedies, including the possession remedy described there. This descriptor records the remedy invoked but does not infer entitlement or outcome.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9-2"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":6,"column":1,"span":12}}]},{"id":"association-collection-configuration","title":"Association collection configuration","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9","il-condo-act-9-2","il-condo-act-18-4"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"collection-policy-reference","kind":"text","label":"Collection policy / procedure reference","binding":"association.collections.policy_reference","help":"Association-specific policy if one exists; this field does not assert that a separate written collection policy is universally required as of the descriptor date.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"late-charge-reference","kind":"text","label":"Late-charge authority / schedule reference","binding":"association.collections.late_charge_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"interest-rate","kind":"number","label":"Interest rate, if applied","binding":"association.collections.interest_rate","min":0,"max":100,"step":0.01,"unit":"%","format":"percent","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"management-collection-fee-contract","kind":"text","label":"Management contract collection-fee reference","binding":"association.collections.management_fee_contract_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"management-collection-fee-instrument","kind":"text","label":"Declaration / bylaws fee-authority reference","binding":"association.collections.management_fee_instrument_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"collection-counsel","kind":"text","label":"Collection counsel / provider","binding":"association.collections.collection_provider","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"collection-notice-reference","kind":"text","label":"Notice template / process reference","binding":"association.collections.notice_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"collection-configuration-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Collection configuration notes","binding":"association.collections.notes","rows":3,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":8}}]},{"id":"active-collection-cases","title":"Owner collection cases","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9","il-condo-act-9-2","il-condo-act-18-4"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"collection-cases","kind":"collection","label":"Collection cases","binding":"association.collections.cases","min_items":0,"item_label":"Collection case","actions":{"add_label":"Add collection case","remove_label":"Remove collection case"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"collection-case-unit","kind":"text","label":"Unit reference","binding":"unit_reference","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"collection-case-status","kind":"select","label":"Status","binding":"status","options":[{"value":"monitoring","label":"Monitoring"},{"value":"notice","label":"Notice / demand"},{"value":"lien","label":"Lien asserted / recorded"},{"value":"court","label":"Court proceeding"},{"value":"payment_plan","label":"Payment arrangement"},{"value":"resolved","label":"Resolved"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":3,"span":2}},{"id":"collection-case-opened","kind":"date","label":"Opened","binding":"opened_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":2}},{"id":"collection-common-expenses","kind":"number","label":"Unpaid common expenses","binding":"common_expenses","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":2}},{"id":"collection-fines","kind":"number","label":"Unpaid fines","binding":"fines","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":2}},{"id":"collection-interest","kind":"number","label":"Interest","binding":"interest","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"collection-late-charges","kind":"number","label":"Late charges","binding":"late_charges","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":3,"span":2}},{"id":"collection-attorney-fees","kind":"number","label":"Attorney fees","binding":"attorney_fees","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":5,"span":2}},{"id":"collection-costs","kind":"number","label":"Other collection costs","binding":"collection_costs","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":2}},{"id":"collection-fine-process-reference","kind":"text","label":"Fine notice/hearing reference","binding":"fine_process_reference","help":"Populate when unpaid fines are included.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"collection-lien-record-reference","kind":"text","label":"Lien recording reference","binding":"lien_record_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"collection-court-reference","kind":"text","label":"Court / proceeding reference","binding":"court_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"collection-case-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Case notes / evidence references","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":9,"span":4}}]}]},{"id":"lien-and-successor-events","title":"Lien, foreclosure and successor events","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"lien-events","kind":"collection","label":"Lien and foreclosure events","binding":"association.collections.lien_events","min_items":0,"item_label":"Event","actions":{"add_label":"Add lien event","remove_label":"Remove lien event"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"lien-event-unit","kind":"text","label":"Unit reference","binding":"unit_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"lien-event-kind","kind":"select","label":"Event","binding":"kind","options":[{"value":"lien_notice_recorded","label":"Lien notice recorded"},{"value":"association_foreclosure_filed","label":"Association lien foreclosure filed"},{"value":"mortgage_foreclosure_sale","label":"Mortgage foreclosure sale"},{"value":"deed_in_lieu","label":"Deed in lieu"},{"value":"court_possession","label":"Court-ordered possession"},{"value":"successor_transfer","label":"Successor transfer"},{"value":"encumbrancer_statement_request","label":"Encumbrancer statement request"},{"value":"other","label":"Other"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":3,"span":3}},{"id":"lien-event-date","kind":"date","label":"Event date","binding":"event_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":6,"span":2}},{"id":"lien-event-record-reference","kind":"text","label":"Recording / court reference","binding":"record_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":8,"span":3}},{"id":"lien-event-request-date","kind":"date","label":"Statement request date","binding":"statement_request_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"lien-event-response-date","kind":"date","label":"Statement response date","binding":"statement_response_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":3,"span":2}},{"id":"lien-event-successor-obligation","kind":"number","label":"Successor amount recorded","binding":"successor_amount","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":5,"span":3}},{"id":"lien-event-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Event notes","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":8,"span":5}}]}]}]}]}